On 07/29/2016 09:53 AM, Matt Brown wrote:
> So that I can rerun the model can you direct me towards a source that
> will provide the syntax that I will need to run in order to divide the
> variable by 10 as you recommend?

You should do this before you run lavaan. In R, you can type:

mydata$ISEImo2 <- mydata$ISEImo / 10

and then use 'ISEImo2' in your model instead of 'ISEImo'

Yves.

